  "label": "User projected onto the 'karen' stereotype via the angry cat visual metaphor",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the 'karen' stereotype, which is visually represented by the angry cat. The text 'karen' at the top explicitly labels the cat as embodying this stereotype, and the phrase 'get your shit together' at the bottom is directed at the cat (and by extension, the 'karen' it represents). The user sees themselves or others as the target of this mockery, projecting their own identity or perception onto the cat as the 'karen' figure. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'cat' and the TextualMaterial entity 'top_text' (karen), which together form the core of the meme's metaphor.",
